g1 warning bank-sizing: House bank is 400 Ah; daily use is ~183 Ah, which suggests ~740 Ah for two days at safe depth of discharge. → Increase house capacity or reduce loads.
g2 info house-start-split: No dedicated start battery: the engine starts from the house bank. → Add a start battery (role "Engine start") so a flat house bank can never stop you starting the engine."
`;

